ainer`): faceless one-idea explainer shorts built from a bold screen-print cutout collage still (`gpt-image-2`) animated into a living collage with Seedance 2.0, narrated in a calm \"In a Nutshell\" documentary voice (see `MOT\n<truncated 38219 bytes>\n-image real_person_reference.jpg --prompt \"Create a distinct fictional UGC creator...\" --size 1024x1536 --quality high --input-fidelity high --model gpt-image-2\r\n324: python3 .agents/skills/super-video-maker/tools/agent_browser_recorder.py\r\n325: python3 .agents/skills/super-video-maker/tools/local_explainer_broll.py\r\n326: python3 .agents/skills/super-video-maker/tools/screen_recorder.py\r\n327: python3 .agents/skills/super-video-maker/tools/demo_video_composer.py\r\n328: python3 .agents/skills/super-video-maker/tools/video_captioner.py\r\n329: python3 .agents/skills/super-video-maker/tools/ffmpeg_qc.py\r\n330: python3 .agents/skills/super-video-maker/tools/broll_layout_qc.py\r\n331: ```\r\n332: \r\n333: ## Result contract\r\n334: \r\n335: Each stage should end with one line:\r\n336: \r\n337: ```json\r\n338: RESULT: {\"status\":\"succeeded\",\"stage\":\"asset_generation\",\"job_id\":\"video_001\",\"artifacts\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"path\":\"output_videos/clip.mp4\"}],\"metrics\":{\"duration_seconds\":7,\"aspect_ratio\":\"16:9\"},\"next_action\":\"assemble_timeline\"}\r\n339: ```\r\n340: \r\n341: On failure:\r\n342: \r\n343: ```json\r\n344: RESULT: {\"status\":\"failed\",\"stage\":\"asset_generation\",\"error\":\"friendly explanation\",\"debug_log\":\"tmp/video_jobs/video_001/log.txt\"}\r\n345: ```\r\n346: \r\n347: ## Provider defaults\r\n348: \r\n349: - Avatar: HeyGen.\r\n350: - AI video b-roll: fal.ai `bytedance/seedance-2.0/reference-to-video` or `bytedance/seedance-2.0/fast/reference-to-video`.\r\n351: - Images: OpenAI image generation/editing.\r\n352: - Voice: ElevenLabs.\r\n353: - Music: ElevenLabs Music first, then Replicate or Suno adapters if configured.\r\n354: - Programmatic editor: Remotion.\r\n355: - HTML-native editor: HyperFrames.\r\n356: - Final render/QC: FFmpeg and ffprobe.\r\n357: \r\n358: ## When not to use this skill\r\n359: \r\n360: - The user only wants a single image.\r\n361: - The user only wants a plain transcript with no video work.\r\n362: - The user asks for manual Premiere/DaVinci steps and does not want automation.\r\n363: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
